# Internal tracking/planning docs — kept locally, not published. STATUS.md
# and BUILD_PLAN.md are working notes, not a public-facing changelog;
# docs/REVIEW-2026-09-15.md specifically documents unpatched security
# findings with reproduction steps and must never be public until every
# finding in it is actually fixed; LAUNCH_RUNBOOK.md is internal ops.
/STATUS.md
/BUILD_PLAN.md
/docs/REVIEW-2026-09-15.md
/LAUNCH_RUNBOOK.md
/LOCAL_TESTING.md
